<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Commissioning Guideline</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
        .header-logo { text-align: right; font-size: 30px; }
        .section-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .guideline-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .body-text { line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .step-number { font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px; }
        .image-placeholder { height: 300px; background-color: #eee; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #888; }
        .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 50px; right: 60px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 50px; }
  .logo { font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; }
  .contact-info { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 50px; left: 60px; right: 60px; font-size: 10px; color: #777; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-logo"><span data-field="company_logo">{{ company_logo }}</span></div>
        <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
            <div class="section-title">COMMISSIONING GUIDELINE</div>
            <div class="guideline-title">How can I install a Software package on my circuit breaker?</div>
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder">Visual Representation of Software Installation</div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">2</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="section-title"></div>
        <div class="body-text">
            The cutting-edge <span data-field="architecture_name">{{ architecture_name }}</span> architecture allows the full customization of moulded case circuit breakers and air circuit breakers. Measuring Packages is one of the available solutions that extends the measuring capabilities of your <span data-field="product_type">{{ product_type }}</span>. It allows adding voltages, powers, energies and counters. In addition it is possible to customize the breaker adding protections, harmonic analysis and further advanced features.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">1</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="guideline-title">How can I install a Software package on my circuit breaker?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            When purchased, the measuring packages are associated with a user account and must be installed using <span data-field="software_name">{{ software_name }}</span>. By following the steps below, you will be able to activate them within seconds. (Please note that this guide was designed assuming the customer has already purchased the package).
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <span class="step-number">1.</span> Open <span data-field="software_name">{{ software_name }}</span> and log in. Make sure your PC is connected to internet throughout the procedure.
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder" style="height: 250px;">Step 1 Image Placeholder</div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">2</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="guideline-title">How can I install a Software package on my circuit breaker?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <span class="step-number">2.</span> Using a T&P, connect your PC to the trip unit in which you want to install the SW package.
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder" style="height: 250px;">Step 2 Image Placeholder</div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">3</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="guideline-title">How can I install a Software package on my circuit breaker?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <span class="step-number">3.</span> Click on T&P Scan.
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder" style="height: 350px;">Step 3 Image Placeholder</div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">4</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="guideline-title">How can I install a Software package on my circuit breaker?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <span class="step-number">4.</span> Once your circuit breaker has been scanned, go to the Marketplace option. Here you will find 3 main tabs in the upper right corner:
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Catalogue:</strong> This section displayed the suggested products for the connected device. The SW package is included in the Measurement category. Once installed it is not longer present.</li>
                <li><strong>My Device:</strong> Packages that are already activated on the trip unit are displayed in this section.</li>
                <li><strong>My Orders:</strong> Products that have been purchased and are ready for activation are listed here, as well as the activated products for the connected device.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder" style="height: 300px;">Step 4 Image Placeholder</div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">5</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="guideline-title">How can I install a Software package on my circuit breaker?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <span class="step-number">5.</span> Go to My Orders.
            <br><br>
            <span class="step-number">6.</span> Click on Activate.
            <br><br>
            The activation will take a few seconds and a message will be displayed when complete.
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder" style="height: 250px;">Step 5 & 6 Image Placeholder</div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">7</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="guideline-title">How can I install a Software package on my circuit breaker?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <span class="step-number">7.</span> The package will be shown as Activate in both My Orders and My Device sections.
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder" style="height: 250px;">Step 7 Image Placeholder</div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">8</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="guideline-title">How can I install a Software package on my circuit breaker?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <span class="step-number">8.</span> Restart the device. Also make sure the T&P is disconnected.
        </div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <span class="step-number">9.</span> Reconnect the device to your PC using a T&P. In case of Measuring Package or Network Analyzer installation and if the circuit breaker has already been published in <span data-field="platform_name">{{ platform_name }}</span>, a re-commissioning is required to be able to see the new measurement values on the plat form. If more than one Measuring package has been purchased, repeat the same procedure for in stallation on the other circuit breakers.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">5</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="section-title">How can I transfer a license, from the buyer to another user, using the Redeem Code?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            The Redeem code is a code received, by the buyer, after the purchasing order and unlock the possibility to transfer the licenses. The buyer can share the Redeem Code with another user in order to transfer the license.
        </div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <strong>How to do it?</strong>
            <br>
            Selecting the Marketplace page on Ekip Connect 3, under the "Catalogue" tab, the user that received the Redeem Code from the buyer has to fill in the code inside of the following window and click on "Transfer". The code format is XXXXXXXXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXXXXXXXXXX.
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder" style="height: 300px;">License Transfer Image Placeholder</div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;"></div>
            <div class="footer">6</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-bottom: 2px solid #cc0000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
        <div class="section-title">How can I transfer a license, from the buyer to another user, using the Redeem Code?</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            The license of the package transferred appears on the Marketplace page on Ekip Connect 3, under the "My Orders" tab. A license can be transferred only one time. Once transferred it appears as "locked" and cannot be transferred anymore (the license can be used by the final user only).
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder" style="height: 250px;">License Transfer Status Image Placeholder</div>
        <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            For further questions do not hesitate to contact us: <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 50px; }
  .logo { font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; }
  .contact-info { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 50px; left: 60px; right: 60px; font-size: 10px; color: #777; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="contact-info">
      <strong>ABB SACE</strong><br>
      A division of <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="employer.address_line_1">Via <span data-field="employer.street_name">{{ employer.address_line_1">Via <span data-field= }}</span></span><br>
      <span data-field="employer.city_country">{{ employer.city_country }}</span><br>
      Phone: <span data-field="employer.phone">{{ employer.phone }}</span><br>
      Fax: <span data-field="employer.fax">{{ employer.fax }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="employer.website">{{ employer.website }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="logo">ABB</div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    The data and illustrations are not binding. We reserve the right to modify the contents of this document on the basis of technical development of the products, without prior notice. © Copyright <span data-field="copyright_year">{{ copyright_year }}</span>. All rights reserved.
  </div>
</div></body>
</html>